# Cloudflare static-asset redirects.
#
# The site was restructured when the project became open source and self-hosted:
# the two /*/about marketing pages moved under /tools/, the OA Response Agent was
# shortened to OA Agent, Reviewer was removed, and the billing pages are gone.
# These URLs are in the sitemap and may be indexed, so they redirect rather than 404.

/oa-response/about       /tools/oa-agent           301
/patent-reader/about     /tools/patent-reader      301
/reviewer                /                         301
/subscribe               /                         301

# The running apps need a local backend and are excluded from the public build.
# Send visitors to the page that explains the tool instead of a dead route.
/oa-response             /tools/oa-agent           301
/oa-agent                /tools/oa-agent           302
/patent-reader           /tools/patent-reader      302
/check-antecedent-basis  /tools/antecedent-basis   302
